---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Elah" description="What elah.one collects, why, and how to ask us to delete it." path="/privacy" og="home">
  <section class="sec first">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="h-l" data-reveal>Privacy.</h1>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:32px">
        <p>We build AI that keeps your data at home, so we try to collect as little as possible here too. Last updated November 2026.</p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>What you send us in a form:</b> your email, and anything else you choose to add, such as your name, company or a note.</li>
          <li><b>Anonymous visit counts:</b> we use Vercel Web Analytics to see which pages are visited and roughly where visitors come from. It doesn't use cookies and doesn't identify you.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To reply to you, and to send you news about Elah and Node if you joined early access.</li>
          <li>We don't sell your details, and we don't share them with advertisers.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Who handles it</h2>
        <p>Form submissions are delivered to our inbox by Web3Forms, a form-delivery service. If you choose to message us on WhatsApp, WhatsApp's own terms apply to that conversation. The site is hosted by Vercel.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>Every email we send has a way to unsubscribe. To see or delete what we hold about you, use the <a href="/company#contact">contact form</a> and we'll take care of it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
